Makedog

  A development tool for server binaries: watch and restart, log, run make targets, and more

- Watch and restart after compilation
- Log every run, with easy retrieval
- Send signals and file inputs to your program

It does not watch your source code and recompile. Your coding agent can do this in a more robust way.

